In an Axios-based SPA, unauthenticated API calls return a 302 to redirect the user to the login page, but Axios/browser behavior makes a subsequent request immediately. I tried disabling redirects with `maxRedirects: 0` in an interceptor setup, but Axios still follows redirects:

